subtitle: [? if psc_parlament_s >= 24: Without any intervention, that's bound to happen. ?][? if party_resources >= 1 and psc_parlament_s < 24: Given her results, without our intervention he might lose his spot. \[-1 resources\] ?]
on-arrival: party_resources -= 1; psc_relations += 5;

Despite the challenge, Montserrat Tura seems to have manage to subdue internal criticism and lean on her allies to win the internal primaries. Questioning her leadership again may be hard from now on, and it seems like the PSC-PSOE split will be here to stay.

- @post_event

